$$\n\\begin{aligned}p\\cdot q & ={p}_{x}\\cdot {q}_{x}+{p}_{y}\\cdot {q}_{y}+{p}_{z}\\cdot {q}_{z} \\\\  & =6\\cdot x+1\\cdot 4+4\\cdot (-4) \\\\  & =6x-12.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting the dot product equal to $0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p\\cdot q & =0 \\\\ 6x-12 & =0 \\\\ 6x & =12 \\\\ x & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110567 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290479 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110567 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290517 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110567 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290521 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110568 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290477 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110568 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290478 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110568 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290522 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110568 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290523 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110572 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290278 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110605 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290328 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110605 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290329 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110606 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290460 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110606 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290473 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110606 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290474 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110607 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290330 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110607 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290331 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110607 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290332 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110607 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290333 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110608 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290475 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110671 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290516 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186110760 1038 #edb/ref 17592186290455 13194139533408 17592186045585 true] [17592186111000 1068 